  m_Name: ArcadeGameLongshot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 95
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Longshot
  Description: 'Serpents only - a timed shoot. Lances of loose prisms hang round the core. Hold the
    scope and your sniper round breaks every prism on its line: line up along a lance and
    one shot takes the whole run, fire across it and you take a prism or two. Your rifle
    needs twelve seconds between shots, so make each one count - and a rival flying straight
    leaves a lance of their own colour behind them. The most prisms broken when the clock
    runs out wins. Higher intensities bend the lances into shorter runs, farther out.'
